{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dancing with Ghosts is a wholesome, interactive-narrative with a compelling, heartfelt story full of charm and humor. The interactive narrative is set within the chill, sim-type gameplay of a living village. Players play the role of Mai, a 15 year old Thai girl who feels lost and overcome with guilt because of the death of her parents. Mai meets an 11 year old ghost, who has lost her memory and who is trapped in this world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this demo players will play from the beginning of the story up until the point where Mai meets her new ghost friend.\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3986240?t=1757600321","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3986240?t=1757600321","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986240/45cee1d6e6c79f26bde22225e07effe2b96669c5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757600321","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986240/45cee1d6e6c79f26bde22225e07effe2b96669c5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757600321","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dancing with Ghosts is a wholesome, interactive-narrative with a compelling, heartfelt story full of charm and humor. The interactive narrative is set within the chill, sim-type gameplay of a living village. Players play the role of Mai, a 15 year old Thai girl who feels lost and overcome with guilt because of the death of her par